# Generated and hand-written sources here are emitted with LF by the Rust
# generator. Without this, core.autocrlf rewrites the working copy to CRLF and
# every regeneration shows as "modified" with an empty diff, which blocks
# merges and hides real changes.
*.cs text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.csproj text eol=lf
